sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Subject as User or machine principal
  participant PEP as Edge or service enforcement point
  participant ID as Identity and risk services
  participant PIP as Authoritative attribute sources
  participant PDP as Policy decision point
  participant Domain as Domain and resource store
  participant Audit as Audit and security evidence

  Subject->>PEP: Request with credential and resource reference
  PEP->>ID: Validate issuer, credential, assurance, session and device risk
  ID-->>PEP: Authenticated subject/workload context
  PEP->>Domain: Load trusted resource tenant, owner and state
  Domain-->>PEP: Authoritative resource attributes
  PEP->>PIP: Resolve membership, role, licence, country, classification and workflow
  PIP-->>PEP: Versioned attributes and provenance
  PEP->>PDP: Evaluate action and full context
  PDP-->>PEP: ALLOW, DENY, CHALLENGE or REQUIRE_APPROVAL plus obligations
  PEP->>Audit: Record decision, versions, reason and correlation
  alt Allowed and obligations satisfied
    PEP->>Domain: Execute domain-authorized action
    Domain-->>PEP: Minimized result and durable evidence reference
    PEP-->>Subject: Safe response
  else Challenge or approval required
    PEP-->>Subject: Step-up or governed approval required
  else Denied, missing or conflicting policy
    PEP-->>Subject: Safe denial
  end
